     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Here's an offer: using the Cargo Maven plugin:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://cargo.codehaus.org/"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://cargo.codehaus.org/",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "would be a great improvement over the current bouquet of Ant scripts that create and tear down test instances. I'd be happy to work on that, because I've had some recent experience with Cargo and was very impressed. ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
